.SS "gboolean dnd_drag_drop (GtkWidget * widget, GdkDragContext * dc, guint timestamp, char * where)"
.PP
DND: drag completed, negotiate content-type. 
.PP
User has tried to drop some data on us. Decide what format we would like the data in. 
.PP
\fBParameters:\fP
.RS 4
\fIwidget\fP the widget 
.br
\fIdc\fP the drag-context 
.br
\fItimestamp\fP when the event happened 
.br
\fIwhere\fP file-system path of the target object (item or 'background')
.RE
.PP

